 "title": "Readymade property | Riyad Bank",
 "text": "Skip to Main Content\nReadymade property\nPersonal\nPrivate\nMSME\nCorporate\nInvestor relations\nالعربية\nATM & branches\nContact and Support\nLog in\nCreate account\nAccounts\nCards\nFinance\nHassad\nAbout us\nExplore Banking\nHome\n>\nFinance\n>\nMortgage Loan\n>\nReadymade property\nReadymade Property\nHome finance products from Riyad Bank offer you Shariah-compliant financing solutions based on the principles of Murabaha and Ijara. \nApply Now\n       \n         \nOverview\nEligibility\nHow to apply\nFAQS\nExplore more options\nApply Now\nOVERVIEW\nOverview\n\nRiyad Bank helps you to own your dream home through flexible Shariah-compliance financing programs based on the principles of Murabaha and Ijara.\n\nFinancing amount up to S..R 5 million\nPossibility of joint finance between the primary applicant + 3 first degree relatives\nPossibility of having more than one finance\nAbility to add/cancel joint applicants\nPossibility of early settlement / transfer ownership (Ihlal)/selling to a third party\nCooperative insurance against all risks\nExemption in case of death or permanent disability and transfer of ownership of the property to the heirs in accordance with the insurance coverage\nThe possibility to calculate the financing amount to 77 years for the Governmental and Private sector, and 75 years to the Military sector\n\nFor Home Finance APR disclosure, click here\n\nRead more \nELIGIBILITY\nEligibility\nFor Saudis only\nMinimum monthly salary of S..R 5,000\nFor government, semi-government and private sectors, as well as other bank employees\nSalary transfer is a must (excluding other bank employees)\nHOW TO APPLY\nHow to apply\n\nAll you need to do is visit your nearest Riyad Bank branch with the following documents:\n\nCopy of valid Saudi national ID\nCompleted application form for Home Finance\nCompleted applicant undertaking form\nCompleted applicant health declaration\nSalary certificate with salary details\nBank statement\nDeposit of valuation fees\n\n \nYOUR ANSWERS\nFrequently asked questions\nSee all questions\n01\nAre home Finance products Shariah-compliant?\n02\nWhat are the features and benefits of Riyad Bank Home Finance?\n03\nIs it possible for bank employees to get financed without transferring their salaries?\n04\nWhat is the maximum age required for the property?\n05\nWhat are the properties financed by the bank?\n06\nCan the customer have a joint finance with relatives, such as father, mother, brother, sister, or spouse?\n07\nIs it possible for a non-Saudi husband to have a joint finance with his Saudi wife?\n08\nWhat is the minimum down payment required when purchasing a property?\n09\nWho owns the title deed of the property?\n10\nIs there an early settlement option?\n11\nHow does the profit rate change during the finance period?\n12\nIs it possible to build the land after purchasing it?\n13\nCan the customer lease the property after purchasing it?\n14\nCan the customer sell the property during the repayment period?\n15\nCan the customer have two financing products at the same time?\n16\nIs it possible to finance the purchase of an incomplete property?\n17\nIs it possible to pay quarterly or biannual installments?\n18\nIs it possible to purchase a property without transferring the salary?\n19\nIs it possible to get a Home Finance against shares/deposits?\n20\nWhat are the benefits of life insurance and property insurance?\n21\nWhat is the maximum amount of financing?\n22\nWhat is the minimum amount of financing that can be provided?\nWHAT'S AFTER APPLYING ONLINE\nWhat's after applying online?\n\nVisit your nearest Riyad Bank branch with the following documents:\n\nCopy of valid Saudi national ID\nCompleted application form for Home Finance\nCompleted applicant undertaking form\nCompleted applicant health declaration\nSalary certificate with salary details\nBank statement\nDeposit of valuation fees\n \n\nFor more information please call our toll free number 800-124-2020\n\nThe calculations allow you to only simulate approximate loan amounts and estimated monthly repayments. For exact figures please contact us on: 800-124-2020, or visit any of our branches here.\n\nRead more \nApply Online - Purchasing Readymade Property \nHome Finance products from Riyad Bank offer you Shariah-compliant financing solutions based on the principles of Murabaha and Ijara. Customers can purchase the property of their choice with flexible payment plans and competitive profit margins.\nPlease complete the form below\nInterested in\nPersonal Loan\nAuto Lease\nMortgage Finance\nInterested in\nPersonal Loan\nAuto Lease\nMortgage Finance\nBy ticking the checkbox, you agree to Riyad Bank collecting and processing and sharing [Name, National ID number, Email address, Mobile number, and city of residence.] For the purpose of assessing your financing request and enabling our sales team to contact you to complete the application process, as per the published privacy notice in the bank’s website.\nApply now\nCalculate\nEXPLORE MORE OPTIONS\nYou may also like\nCredit cards\nDistinct set of credit cards with innovative banking solutions to meet unique lifestyle\nPersonal Finance\nSometimes you need extra cash. Trust a bank that supports you and helps finance your needs.\nAuto Leasing\nOwn your dream car without full payment. Riyad Bank Auto Leasing makes ownership easy and convenient.\n\nBANKING MADE EASY FOR YOU\n\nLet us simplify your financial life\n\nJoin Riyad Bank for secure, seamless, and stress-free banking. Take the first step today.\n\nJoin Now\nCheck our Services\nNeed help?\nRiyad Line: 800 124 2225\nSupport Hotline\nContact us\nBranch & ATM\nView on map\nFAQ\nGet your answer\nProduct & Services\nAccounts\nCards\nFinance\nPrograms\nPayments & Transfers\nHassad World\nDigital Banking Channels\nRiyad Online\nRiyad Mobile\nRiyad Line\nRiyad ATM\nForeign Exchange ATM\nRiyad Smartwatches\nRiyad Self Service\nInfo, Tools & Services\nFinance Calculator\nIBAN Generator\nProduct Comparison\nRetail & Corporate\nRetail Banking Charges\nSuppliers Portal\nBanking Consumer Protection Principles\nTariff of Banking Services\nManage Cookies\nAbout us\nWho We Are\nCareers\nBoard of Directors\nBukra\nVision 2030\nAwards\nRiyad Bank Compliance\nCustomer Care\nPMI\nRiyad Bank Bylaws\nMedia Centre\nPress Releases\nPR & External Communication\nSponsorship Request\n© 2026 Riyad Bank. All rights Reserved\nRiyad Bank, Public Shareholding Company, Capital of S..R 40 Billion, Commercial Register (1010001054), P.O. Box 13519 Riyadh 6671, Tel. +966 11 4013030, National Address: King Abdullah Financial District (KAFD) Financial Boulevard - Al Aqeeq District - Building No. 3128 - Riyadh, Kingdom of Saudi Arabia. www.riyadbank.com, is licensed by the Council of Ministers Resolution (91) dated 23.11.1957, and regulated by Saudi Central Bank.\nPrivacy Notice\nTerms of Use\nSitemap",
